### 1. Metadados do Serviço
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diagnostico/modelo
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Accept: application/json

### 2. Predição com Perfil A (válido — cliente administrativo, contato cellular, campanha curta)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 45,
  "job": "admin.",
  "marital": "married",
  "education": "secondary",
  "default": "no",
  "balance": 1500,
  "housing": "yes",
  "loan": "no",
  "contact": "cellular",
  "day": 15,
  "month": "may",
  "duration": 800,
  "campaign": 2,
  "pdays": -1,
  "previous": 0,
  "poutcome": "unknown"
}

### 3. Predição com Perfil B (válido — cliente aposentado, saldo alto, campanha longa)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
User-Agent: Tester-Audit-Agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 62,
  "job": "retired",
  "marital": "divorced",
  "education": "tertiary",
  "default": "no",
  "balance": 8500,
  "housing": "no",
  "loan": "no",
  "contact": "telephone",
  "day": 20,
  "month": "oct",
  "duration": 2100,
  "campaign": 1,
  "pdays": 120,
  "previous": 3,
  "poutcome": "success"
}

